---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Qemu Vi Lab"
  description="AI Security, Binary Analysis, and System Security"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">AI Security · Binary Analysis · System Security</div>

    <h1>Qemu Vi Lab</h1>

    <p>
      这里记录我的 AI 辅助安全分析、二进制程序分析、漏洞检测、逆向工程、
      安全态势感知和研究生阶段的技术成长。
    </p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/projects/">View Projects</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/blog/">Read Blog</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/zhq-coder" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Focus Areas</h2>

    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>AI Security</h3>
        <p>关注 LLM、深度学习与安全自动化分析的结合。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Binary Analysis</h3>
        <p>研究二进制程序分析、逆向工程、函数语义理解与漏洞检测。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Security Engineering</h3>
        <p>构建可落地的安全检测、日志分析和态势感知系统。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-top: 48px;">
    <h2 class="section-title">Featured Projects</h2>

    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>AI-assisted Binary Analysis System</h3>
        <p>基于 Ghidra / angr / LLM 的二进制函数分析与风险解释系统。</p>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Ghidra</span>
          <span class="tag">angr</span>
          <span class="tag">LLM</span>
          <span class="tag">FastAPI</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Security Situation Awareness System</h3>
        <p>结合 OpenResty、ModSecurity、FastAPI 和 LLM 的安全态势感知平台。</p>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">OpenResty</span>
          <span class="tag">ModSecurity</span>
          <span class="tag">LLM</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Firmware Security Lab</h3>
        <p>面向 IoT 固件的解包、架构识别、服务分析和漏洞函数匹配实验。</p>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Firmware</span>
          <span class="tag">IoT</span>
          <span class="tag">Fuzzing</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>